# Bugbot rules

A translation, not a policy: this file restates `AGENTS.md`'s `## Code Review Rules` for
Bugbot, which doesn't read `AGENTS.md`. The generator writes both from one template, and the
exact-comparison check keeps them identical.

- The same items as `AGENTS.md`'s Code Review Rules, in the same order: tiers, sensitive
  paths by pointer to `.github/governance/record.yml`, finding categories and their
  mapping, the tier challenge, the fixed-content rule, the round-2 rules.
- Nothing Bugbot-only. Its config file, `.cursor/config/bugbot.yaml`, isn't written: habit
  set Bugbot to run only on request in Cursor's settings.
